{"root":"pli/ms","translators":["sujato"],"title":"The Partridge: a past life story","html":"<article id='ja37'><header><ul><li class='division'><span class='root'>Jātaka </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Stories of Past Lives 37 </span></li>\n<li><span class='root'>Ekakanipāta </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>The Book of the Ones </span></li>\n<li><span class='root'>Kulāvakavagga </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Nests </span></li></ul>\n<h1 class='sutta-title'><span class='root'>7. Tittirajātaka </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>The Partridge: a past life story </span></h1></header>\n<blockquote class='gatha'><p><span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>“Ye vuḍḍhamapacāyanti, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Those people who honor the elder </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>narā dhammassa kovidā; </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>are experts in the teaching; </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Diṭṭheva dhamme pāsaṁsā, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>praised in this life, </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>samparāye ca suggatī”ti. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>they’re destined for happiness in lives to come. </span></span></p></blockquote>\n<p class='endsutta'><span class='root'>Tittirajātakaṁ sattamaṁ. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></p></article>"}
